    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner engineer and artist in <strong>Wind Tunnel Simulator</strong>! Have you ever wondered how a Formula 1 car slices through the air, or what makes an airplane fly? Now you can discover it for yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5ea4b5cfe759a3b06ef579369d1cc392.poster.avif?t=1751937832\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5ea4b5cfe759a3b06ef579369d1cc392.webm?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5ea4b5cfe759a3b06ef579369d1cc392.mp4?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game, you get to be the designer. Using intuitive, clay-like sculpting tools, you can craft anything you can imagine - from sleek sports cars to futuristic aircraft, or even just delightfully weird shapes. There are no limits to your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/e247e6f0ca6db8a67a0b70e74f246e74.poster.avif?t=1751937832\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/e247e6f0ca6db8a67a0b70e74f246e74.webm?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/e247e6f0ca6db8a67a0b70e74f246e74.mp4?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your design is ready, take it to the state-of-the-art wind tunnel. With the press of a button, you can watch a beautiful, real-time simulation of the airflow around your creation. See how the air bends and swirls, and get instant feedback on its aerodynamic performance. Is your design a champion of speed, or a master of flight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5264a9f64bfc3d171c8fcc875415dd60.poster.avif?t=1751937832\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5264a9f64bfc3d171c8fcc875415dd60.webm?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5264a9f64bfc3d171c8fcc875415dd60.mp4?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive 3D Sculpting:</strong>\u00a0Mold, shape, and combine objects with ease. It's like playing with digital clay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Our advanced physics engine shows you exactly how your designs will behave in a wind tunnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visualizations:</strong> See the invisible! Watch airflow, pressure, and velocity in real-time with beautiful, easy-to-understand visual effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Levels:</strong> Test your skills with a series of puzzles that will push your design abilities to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> Don't like rules? Jump into the sandbox and build whatever you want, with no objectives to worry about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share Your Creations:</strong> Save your favorite designs and show them off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a curious gamer, a budding designer, or a physics enthusiast, **Wind Tunnel Simulator** offers a unique and satisfying experience of creation, testing, and discovery.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner engineer and artist in <strong>Wind Tunnel Simulator</strong>! Have you ever wondered how a Formula 1 car slices through the air, or what makes an airplane fly? Now you can discover it for yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5ea4b5cfe759a3b06ef579369d1cc392.poster.avif?t=1751937832\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5ea4b5cfe759a3b06ef579369d1cc392.webm?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5ea4b5cfe759a3b06ef579369d1cc392.mp4?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game, you get to be the designer. Using intuitive, clay-like sculpting tools, you can craft anything you can imagine - from sleek sports cars to futuristic aircraft, or even just delightfully weird shapes. There are no limits to your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/e247e6f0ca6db8a67a0b70e74f246e74.poster.avif?t=1751937832\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/e247e6f0ca6db8a67a0b70e74f246e74.webm?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/e247e6f0ca6db8a67a0b70e74f246e74.mp4?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your design is ready, take it to the state-of-the-art wind tunnel. With the press of a button, you can watch a beautiful, real-time simulation of the airflow around your creation. See how the air bends and swirls, and get instant feedback on its aerodynamic performance. Is your design a champion of speed, or a master of flight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5264a9f64bfc3d171c8fcc875415dd60.poster.avif?t=1751937832\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5264a9f64bfc3d171c8fcc875415dd60.webm?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620930/extras/5264a9f64bfc3d171c8fcc875415dd60.mp4?t=1751937832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive 3D Sculpting:</strong>\u00a0Mold, shape, and combine objects with ease. It's like playing with digital clay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Our advanced physics engine shows you exactly how your designs will behave in a wind tunnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visualizations:</strong> See the invisible! Watch airflow, pressure, and velocity in real-time with beautiful, easy-to-understand visual effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Levels:</strong> Test your skills with a series of puzzles that will push your design abilities to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> Don't like rules? Jump into the sandbox and build whatever you want, with no objectives to worry about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share Your Creations:</strong> Save your favorite designs and show them off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a curious gamer, a budding designer, or a physics enthusiast, **Wind Tunnel Simulator** offers a unique and satisfying experience of creation, testing, and discovery.</p>",
    "short_description": "Wind Tunnel Simulator is a creative physics sandbox game that combines intuitive 3D sculpting with realistic aerodynamic simulation. Design and test your own experimental shapes using clay-like modeling tools, then watch them come alive in a state-of-the-art virtual wind tunnel.",
